@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml
title VNPAY Payment Integration Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ActivationBorderColor #333333
    ActivationBackgroundColor #70C5E8
}

actor "Customer" as A
control "Backend (controllers + services)" as BACKEND
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "VNPAY sandbox" as VNPAY
control "PrepaymentExpiryJob" as JOB

autonumber

A -> BACKEND: POST /api/v1/orders {cartItemIds, shippingAddress, paymentMethod: VNPAY}
BACKEND -> DB: Decrease stock, INSERT order and items, INSERT payment (VNPAY, PENDING, vnp_TxnRef)
BACKEND -> BACKEND: Sign vnp_* parameters (HMAC-SHA512, link valid 15 minutes, never past the 24-hour deadline)
BACKEND --> A: 201 OrderResponse with paymentUrl
A -> VNPAY: Open paymentUrl in the browser
A -> VNPAY: Pay with the test card
par Server-to-server
VNPAY -> BACKEND: GET /api/v1/payments/vnpay/ipn?vnp_...
BACKEND -> DB: Verify, lock order, record result once
BACKEND --> VNPAY: 200 {"RspCode":"00","Message":"Confirm Success"} (02 if already recorded)
else Browser redirect
VNPAY -> BACKEND: GET /api/v1/payments/vnpay/return?vnp_...
BACKEND -> DB: Same handler, records the result if the IPN has not yet
BACKEND --> A: 302 to app-redirect-url?orderId=...&status=...
end
A -> BACKEND: GET /api/v1/orders/{id}
BACKEND --> A: status PAID, paymentStatus COMPLETED (or FAILED, payable again)
loop Every 5 minutes
JOB -> DB: Find PENDING VNPAY orders older than 24 hours without a COMPLETED payment
JOB -> BACKEND: Cancel each order in its own transaction
BACKEND -> DB: Lock order, cancel remaining lines, restore stock once, pending payments FAILED, order CANCELLED
end

@enduml
